  "description": "Casey Kennedy Estate Agents are delighted to present this spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment at Newpark to the rental market. Set within an attractive gated development, the apartment offers a bright, well-finished interior, a large decked patio and two designated underground parking spaces.\n\nThe entrance hall has solid wood flooring, which continues into the open-plan living and dining room. Floor-to-ceiling windows bring in plenty of natural light, while a gas fireplace makes the room feel comfortable and inviting. Doors open onto the decked patio, providing a generous outdoor space.\n\nThe separate kitchen is fully fitted, with ample counter and cupboard space, tiled flooring and an adjoining utility room. Both bedrooms are doubles, with fitted wardrobes and carpeted floors. The main bedroom has an en-suite bathroom, while a second bathroom serves the rest of the apartment.\n\nNewpark is located at the corner of Newtownpark Avenue and the N11, close to local shops, cafés, restaurants and other amenities. Dublin Bus services nearby provide access to the city centre. The development is also served by a lift.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment through Casey Kennedy Estate Agents.",
